{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f635b011f9b30c74226102734997da3ffbf816d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b9321edbbf1f120b4fdedd1edbeaa59b91059978.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{4}{3}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" /> and passes through the origin, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35edf96252eba7402bbd237547e8ce10796778d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41ed9764877afbbe4af71f580dbe5e3c3ebd00ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{1}{2}x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" /> and crosses the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f635b011f9b30c74226102734997da3ffbf816d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35edf96252eba7402bbd237547e8ce10796778d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What are the coordinates of points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />? (No justification is required.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis, it must have a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate can just be found by plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b15c3d8837521362dc42d34c05dea766b862283.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = -\\frac{1}{2}x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f5298385406e48b290883b8897564e073f1ac7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/955e53564566d225781e9cedc0efb07da1b762cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5 \\times 2 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is then at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df778ab8bed41fd98d52707d714de8f26764773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(10, 0)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is where the two lines intersect, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e8edd5ed34f3649439b94cad0343be034ab55e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{4}{3}x = -\\frac{1}{2}x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/0/68040c5b8ac8edfa08f4f6f25f09cb9748a4675b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4x \\times 2 = -3 \\times x + 5 \\times 3 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/29996af3b6f1c83e41a32ab36a1d6516dad7d244.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8x = -3x + 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b772474253a45029ddd0e69a095f38f3479dafe7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-30 = -3x + 8x = 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/4275deb3b022d9ad91ac509454f07a8861158cf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-30}{5} = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fa23f8501dd4ce727f6073133d1ee408f1aaad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{4}{3} \\times -6 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is located at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2881197cc64553f476c5cd5cd5c6a5685aae81bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(-6, 8)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"68\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055315\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 543/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5954/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.378      1 2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\n100.00%    8.378      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37087:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018055315 and revision id 286392. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}